<li>MULO, Yogyakarta (1945)</li>
<li>SGB/SGA, Yogyakarta (1948)</li>
<li>Paedagogische Leergang, Bandung (1954)</li>
<li>Universitas Nebraska Lincoln, Nebraska, AS (M.Ed., 1957)</li>
<li>Universitas Harvard, Cambridge, Massachussetts, AS (M.A., 1969 dan Doktor, 1975)</li>
</ul>
